Proposed Methodology
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
From the problem definition, you identify key techniques and approaches
 you feel are necessary to successfully find a resolution.
 You can further motivate the approaches by outlining how they were used
 in other contexts.
 This is an extension of the Literature review but with emphasis on how
 you intend to apply the methodology/ies to your problem.
\end_layout

